00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.740
*in pig latin* Are you gay?

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.840
Just ask them! Use your words!

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.200
Nerdfighters, thanks for the great questions.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.840
Hank, I have to go get on a plane. I will see you on Friday!

